        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/sheep/scene_sheep.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3b1bffed-bbcf-446e-8824-5855f9df7714).Image",
        "Description": "These three men have each engaged in acts of debauchery. Jarvis regularly torments baby turtles, preventing them from getting to the ocean after they&apos;ve hatched. Perry likes kicking pebbles off the roof, aiming to annoy his colleagues below. And Orson has been repeatedly silly on the job. Retire them all for a kirse.\r\r(I killed Orson Mills with inhaled poison rather than poison that was drank or eaten, so if you manage to do that as well you&apos;ll have my everlasting respect)",
